    "ssky_timeline_block_WEGmXR": {
      "type": "ssky-timeline-block",
      "blocks": {
        "timeline_column_FrPyfB": {
          "type": "timeline_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-2",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/46514247_10104676848554979_2274094095565586432_n.webp",
            "image_fit": false,
            "caption": "",
            "text_style": "large-bold",
            "heading": "<p>1 Million Books Sold</p>",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "caption_b": "",
            "text_style_b": "large-bold",
            "text": "<p>In early 2020, we reached a significant milestone for our self-published book series: we sold our millionth book! This was a great celebration for our team and a validation that what we were doing mattered to so many families.</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular",
            "text_b": "",
            "text_size_b": "regular",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "timeline_column_feNF8E": {
          "type": "timeline_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-2",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/untitled-14.webp",
            "image_fit": false,
            "caption": "",
            "text_style": "large-bold",
            "heading": "<p>New Books for Toddlers and Teens</p>",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "caption_b": "",
            "text_style_b": "large-bold",
            "text": "<p>The growing success of our book series led us to create books for younger and older children so we could expand our reach and better serve families with kids of varying ages.</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular",
            "text_b": "",
            "text_size_b": "regular",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "timeline_column_BMfgwi": {
          "type": "timeline_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-2",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/23800334_10103957449212029_2736957895683920767_o.webp",
            "image_fit": false,
            "caption": "",
            "text_style": "large-bold",
            "heading": "<p>Huge Surge in Book Sales</p>",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "caption_b": "",
            "text_style_b": "large-bold",
            "text": "<p>In our first six years, 2014-2019, we sold a total of 750,000 books—pretty impressive for a brand new self-published project! But in 2020 alone, we sold 1.3 million copies, nearly double our entire past six years!<br/><br/>So many families were troubled by school shutdowns, activist teachers, authoritarian politicians, and the decay of our society. When they went looking for answers, the Tuttle Twins team was there to introduce our books and help them teach their kids the time-tested ideas of liberty as a means to make our world a better place.</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular",
            "text_b": "",
            "text_size_b": "regular",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "timeline_column_ETKmdA": {
          "type": "timeline_column",
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "scheme-2",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Group-102947-1.webp",
            "image_fit": false,
            "caption": "",
            "text_style": "large-bold",
            "heading": "<p>Launched Our Podcast “The Way the World Works”</p>",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "caption_b": "",
            "text_style_b": "large-bold",
            "text": "<p>To help families learn even more about the ideas of liberty, we launched a new podcast featuring 15-minute episodes so parents and their kids together can quickly learn about and discuss important ideas related to what’s going on in the world.</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "regular",
            "text_b": "",
            "text_size_b": "regular",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
