            "caption": "",
            "text_style": "large-bold",
            "heading": "<p>Tuttle Times Monthly Magazine Launched</p>",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "heading_weight": "bold",
            "caption_b": "",
            "text_style_b": "large-bold",
            "text": "<p>Our books have been extremely popular, but we wanted to put out more regular content for kids to enjoy, so we launched a <a href=\"/collections/magazine\" title=\"Magazine\">monthly magazine subscription</a> so kids can get important mail every few weeks teaching them about current events, economics, history, civics, and more.</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
